// FarmLedger - The main information the system keeps
// Eraser: New diagram > "Entity Relationship" > paste
// Read each box as "a thing the system knows about", each line as "is linked to".

Farmer [icon: user, color: green] {
  Name
  Phone number
  District
}

Farm or animal [icon: map, color: green] {
  Field location and crop
  Or cow ear tag
}

Insurance agent [icon: user, color: blue] {
  Name
  Districts served
}

Insurance product [icon: package, color: blue] {
  What it covers
  Price
  Payout rule
}

Application [icon: inbox, color: blue] {
  Requested cover
  Supporting documents
  Decision
}

Policy [icon: file-text, color: violet] {
  Amount covered
  Price paid
  Start and end dates
  Status
}

Claim [icon: alert-triangle, color: red] {
  What was lost
  Evidence
  Decision
}

Payment [icon: dollar-sign, color: orange] {
  Amount
  Mobile Money number
}

Farmer < Farm or animal: owns
Insurance agent < Farmer: looks after
Farmer < Application: applies through agent
Insurance product < Application: chosen
Application - Policy: becomes, once paid
Farm or animal < Policy: is covered by
Policy < Claim: raised on
Policy < Payment: premium and payouts
